fixtures/stem_image_dm3/test_STEM_image.dm3,
fixtures/cl_image_dm4/test-MonarcCL_mono-image.dm4 and
fixtures/rgba_image_dm4/test-8.dm4 are test files of
RosettaSciIO (https://github.com/hyperspy/rosettasciio), copied unchanged from
its tag v0.15.0, rsciio/tests/data/digitalmicrograph/2D/. The fixture
dm3_dmw is a copy of the first under a .dmw name, and compressed_workspace
holds the second, compressed, in a ZIP; both are made at test time by
generate.py.

